WEBVTT

01:41.280 --> 01:42.920
Before going to bed tonight,

01:43.520 --> 01:44.520
rub it once more.

01:45.360 --> 01:47.880
You must break up this congestion,

01:47.960 --> 01:48.960
so it can heal faster.

01:49.560 --> 01:50.920
Here it comes.

01:51.640 --> 01:53.080
As the ancients said,

01:53.160 --> 01:55.840
animals' organs are good
for human counterparts.

01:55.920 --> 01:57.680
The temperature is just right. Try it.

01:59.400 --> 02:00.640
Wait, wait.

02:00.720 --> 02:03.280
Qingli always dislikes the soup's oil

02:03.360 --> 02:04.760
and refuses to drink it,
fearing weight gain.

02:04.840 --> 02:06.680
So, I thought of a way.

02:06.760 --> 02:10.160
Look. Insert this straw like this.

02:10.240 --> 02:12.080
Without touching the oil layer on top,

02:12.160 --> 02:14.360
you can drink only the soup at the bottom.

02:14.440 --> 02:16.520
It's full of nutrients in every sip.
Give it a try.

02:19.400 --> 02:21.200
- It's good.
- Drink more then.

02:21.280 --> 02:23.000
It'll help your feet heal faster.

02:23.080 --> 02:24.880
- Thank you, Uncle.
- You're welcome.

02:24.960 --> 02:25.920
Yuan,

02:26.840 --> 02:29.200
you're gonna read so many books?

02:30.840 --> 02:32.840
I want to start a new comic,

02:32.920 --> 02:34.560
but I haven't figured out
what to draw yet.

02:34.640 --> 02:36.360
I've been reading books
for inspiration lately.

02:36.440 --> 02:38.640
For things like this, you can't rush.

02:39.240 --> 02:40.440
Think slowly.

02:43.960 --> 02:46.960
Yuan, don't use your feet.

02:47.040 --> 02:48.560
If anything happens,
call out for help, okay?

02:48.640 --> 02:51.840
You're indeed young,
but you still can't ignore it.

02:51.920 --> 02:53.440
When you're old, you'll regret it.

02:54.040 --> 02:54.960
Don't worry.

02:55.040 --> 02:57.800
I'll be too lazy to stretch out my feet
even when the oil bottle falls.

02:57.880 --> 03:00.600
For even the smallest thing,
I'll be calling out for help nonstop.

03:01.520 --> 03:03.680
Good girl.
Drink more while it's still hot.

03:03.760 --> 03:04.640
OK.

03:17.640 --> 03:22.200
DEAR CHENG: THE ALPACA ISSUE IS OVER
AND I TOOK MR. GU'S CAR BACK

03:22.280 --> 03:23.600
KEEP GOING

03:30.240 --> 03:32.520
BIAO REN

03:50.000 --> 03:52.600
BIAO REN

03:53.200 --> 03:56.200
You should rest often to recover faster.

03:57.160 --> 03:58.640
Thank you, Aunt.

04:03.480 --> 04:05.520
You two should go to bed early.

04:06.040 --> 04:07.280
- Yes.
- Yes.

04:08.120 --> 04:09.360
Let me check your feet.

04:10.960 --> 04:12.680
How did it swell up so much?

04:13.720 --> 04:14.760
Does it hurt?

04:15.560 --> 04:17.680
Let me check the other one.

04:20.279 --> 04:23.960
Yuan, why is your boyfriend so old?

04:24.840 --> 04:27.680
This is the Star of Literature,
blessing me with smooth creativity.

04:27.760 --> 04:29.880
Isn't this your boyfriend's
designated spot?

04:29.960 --> 04:33.160
For my career, I have to temporarily
give up my boyfriend.

04:34.160 --> 04:35.920
I hope the Star of Literature
will bless me

04:36.000 --> 04:37.440
and help me find inspiration soon.

04:38.360 --> 04:39.360
Once your feet are better,

04:39.440 --> 04:42.080
you can go out,
and the inspiration will come.

04:42.160 --> 04:43.440
Be careful with your feet.

04:43.520 --> 04:44.520
It's fine.

04:46.240 --> 04:47.080
Get up.

04:49.520 --> 04:52.800
SOMETHING LIKE AN AUTOBIOGRAPHY

04:52.880 --> 04:53.800
What's this book about?

04:55.440 --> 04:57.320
It's the autobiography
of the director Akira Kurosawa.

04:58.000 --> 04:59.440
I never imagined that the world-famous,

04:59.520 --> 05:01.760
legendary Akira Kurosawa

05:01.840 --> 05:05.200
was once a clumsy, insecure,
and unpopular child.

05:06.120 --> 05:07.720
Why is it about a frog?

05:09.000 --> 05:12.800
Maybe he thought of himself as that frog,

05:12.880 --> 05:15.520
whose ugly reflection in the mirror

05:15.600 --> 05:17.120
scared it so much, it oozed oil.

05:19.360 --> 05:22.280
How come Tang Qi, this swan,
is reading a frog book?

05:22.960 --> 05:24.000
Tang Qi's eyes…

05:25.520 --> 05:26.440
What's wrong with Tang Qi's eyes?

05:29.120 --> 05:30.320
It's nothing.

05:30.400 --> 05:32.240
Tang Qi is completely fine now,

05:32.320 --> 05:34.160
but Mr. Gu still won't let him
go back to work.

05:34.240 --> 05:36.040
He insists on one more day of rest.

05:36.680 --> 05:38.040
So, Su Miao's story is over now.

05:38.120 --> 05:39.320
You can totally move on.

05:39.400 --> 05:40.680
SOMETHING LIKE AN AUTOBIOGRAPHY

05:48.280 --> 05:49.480
It's not mine.

05:51.400 --> 05:52.240
It's not mine either.

06:08.480 --> 06:10.200
Chinese Thriller?

06:10.800 --> 06:12.560
Are we about to start a thriller comic?

06:18.960 --> 06:20.320
It's Su Miao's.

06:22.960 --> 06:24.120
Who's looking for Su Miao?

06:25.280 --> 06:26.360
Tang Qi.

06:27.120 --> 06:29.040
He's sending messages to the deceased?

06:29.760 --> 06:32.280
Does he want to receive
a letter from heaven?

06:44.880 --> 06:46.160
What did Tang Qi say?

06:48.040 --> 06:49.160
He said goodbye to Su Miao.

06:49.800 --> 06:51.440
That's good.

06:51.520 --> 06:53.120
This is finally over.

07:14.640 --> 07:15.640
Hello.

07:19.000 --> 07:20.520
I'm glad to meet you

07:22.040 --> 07:22.960
and like you.

07:25.520 --> 07:28.320
I will lock all my memories of you
deep in my heart

07:30.280 --> 07:31.880
and continue my life's journey.

07:38.480 --> 07:39.320
Goodbye.

07:52.080 --> 07:53.440
Goodbye.

08:37.039 --> 08:38.640
Wait, wait.

08:42.520 --> 08:44.440
- Thank you, Mr. Tang.
- It's okay.

08:57.720 --> 08:59.360
Why hasn't he taken it off?

09:08.480 --> 09:11.440
Oh, it hasn't even been the seventh day
after Su Miao's death.

09:25.040 --> 09:27.280
Mr. Tang, have you had breakfast?

09:28.200 --> 09:29.040
No.

09:30.800 --> 09:33.160
I have extra. Do you want some?

09:33.240 --> 09:35.040
My dad's pan-fried buns are delicious.

09:36.200 --> 09:37.320
No need.

09:44.760 --> 09:47.240
If you don't like greasy breakfasts,

09:47.320 --> 09:50.600
I know a place with organic light meals
that's close to the company.

09:50.680 --> 09:53.920
You can order takeout,
and it'll be here quickly.

09:56.800 --> 09:59.080
Just a small suggestion.

10:01.760 --> 10:03.520
No, thank you.

10:05.800 --> 10:06.760
You're welcome.

10:14.960 --> 10:17.160
Hurry, hurry.
Take down all of her posters.

10:17.240 --> 10:18.080
Throw these away.

10:18.880 --> 10:20.840
This area too. Take it all down.

10:20.920 --> 10:22.000
We can't have anything

10:22.080 --> 10:24.320
related to Su Miao here.

10:24.400 --> 10:25.280
Got it?

10:27.160 --> 10:28.280
Mr. Tang is here.

10:29.400 --> 10:31.120
Hurry, hurry. Back to your desks.

10:31.200 --> 10:32.160
Like nothing happened.

10:32.240 --> 10:34.040
You have to stay relaxed. Hurry, hurry.

10:34.120 --> 10:35.920
Don't be nervous. Don't.

10:37.360 --> 10:40.320
This plan… I think this plan is a bit…

10:40.400 --> 10:41.360
You know…

10:42.280 --> 10:43.520
Tang.

10:43.600 --> 10:44.440
You're back.

10:53.240 --> 10:54.640
Did you see that?

10:54.720 --> 10:56.600
This isn't right. He doesn't look right.

10:56.680 --> 11:00.200
If Tang said, "I've come to work,"
then it would be a problem.

11:00.840 --> 11:03.040
I have to go see what's going on.

11:20.240 --> 11:22.880
Hey, Zhao Yunjie. What's going on?

11:23.480 --> 11:24.320
I don't know.

11:24.400 --> 11:25.240
Mr. Zhou gave the order

11:25.320 --> 11:27.440
to take down everything
related to Su Miao.

11:37.800 --> 11:40.240
Mr. Tang, I'll go back to work now.

11:42.760 --> 11:43.720
Mr. Zhou, Mr. Gu.

11:46.440 --> 11:47.600
You came at the right time.

11:52.640 --> 11:54.320
The Red Mist air cushion sample is ready.

11:55.040 --> 11:55.960
Lin just brought it over.

11:56.560 --> 11:57.480
I thought you…

11:59.280 --> 12:01.400
I didn't expect it to be ready so soon.

12:03.360 --> 12:05.000
The elastic mesh for the sponge core
hasn't been decided.

12:07.280 --> 12:09.480
After preliminary tests,
such as elasticity, durability,

12:09.560 --> 12:10.440
and breathability,

12:10.520 --> 12:13.040
these materials meet the requirements
to balance powder texture.

12:13.120 --> 12:14.440
Besides that,

12:14.520 --> 12:15.960
it's best to have users try it,

12:16.040 --> 12:18.000
so we can consider
the actual user experience.

12:18.080 --> 12:21.400
OK, I'll gather all the employees
for a blind test.

12:21.480 --> 12:23.960
Also, the marketing plan
can be prepared as well.

12:31.800 --> 12:32.640
OK.

12:34.040 --> 12:36.000
I'll report to the investors

12:36.080 --> 12:38.280
that we're launching a new product.

12:40.160 --> 12:42.040
This is our upcoming new product.

12:42.120 --> 12:44.720
Everyone, replace the sponge core
and test the elastic mesh.

12:44.800 --> 12:46.560
Fill in the user experience
in the test form.

12:47.160 --> 12:48.000
Wang Yi should submit

12:48.080 --> 12:50.240
the summary result to Mr. Tang
before getting off work.

12:50.320 --> 12:51.680
- Sure.
- OK.

12:55.840 --> 12:59.000
Zhao Yunjie, prepare a test form
and send it to everyone's email.

12:59.680 --> 13:01.360
Everyone, once you finish the test,
send it to my email.

13:01.440 --> 13:02.640
- Sure.
- OK.

13:06.920 --> 13:09.040
It's delicate, and it fits well.

13:09.120 --> 13:11.800
I thought that the new product
would be delayed

13:11.880 --> 13:12.840
without Mr. Tang here,

13:12.920 --> 13:14.560
but it's actually ahead of schedule.

13:14.640 --> 13:16.240
Mr. Tang's rest and our rest

13:16.320 --> 13:17.720
aren't the same kind of rest.

13:17.800 --> 13:20.160
He's truly a workaholic.

13:22.160 --> 13:24.840
Great. Tang Qi is focused on work.

13:31.560 --> 13:36.920
The sun's set and won't rise
Tomorrow morning

13:37.960 --> 13:43.000
The flowers have withered
And may not bloom next year

13:43.560 --> 13:49.280
The beautiful bird flies away
Without a trace

13:49.360 --> 13:55.400
My inspiration will never
Come back like the bird

13:56.120 --> 14:01.160
My inspiration will never
Come back like the bird

14:02.360 --> 14:07.840
Bie di na ya yo, bie di na ya yo

14:12.160 --> 14:13.360
Whose fish is this?

14:13.440 --> 14:15.000
Mine.

14:15.640 --> 14:18.040
Sorry, the fishing line snapped.
The fish flew away.

14:18.120 --> 14:21.000
I'll compensate for all the losses double.
It's the first fish of the day.

14:21.080 --> 14:22.600
Luckily, it didn't slip away.

14:22.680 --> 14:25.400
Mr. Gu, I'll put the fish
in the water tank and be right back.

14:25.480 --> 14:26.600
I'll leave Mr. Gu here.

14:27.400 --> 14:29.360
- What? Mr. Zhang…
- I'll be right back.

14:33.000 --> 14:33.880
Let me. Let me.

14:34.760 --> 14:36.400
What brought you here to sketch?

14:36.480 --> 14:38.680
My grandpa used to bring me here often.

14:38.760 --> 14:40.320
He fished, and I painted.

14:40.400 --> 14:42.440
Sorry, your painting was ruined.

14:43.040 --> 14:45.280
It's okay. It was just for fun.
If it's ruined, it's ruined.

14:47.480 --> 14:49.680
Don't you need to go to work today?

14:49.760 --> 14:51.080
I'm working now.

14:52.720 --> 14:53.720
Your important client?

14:54.480 --> 14:57.400
My VIP. He's gotten into fishing lately.

14:57.480 --> 14:58.800
He said it's better to talk business

14:58.880 --> 15:00.960
facing the scenery than over a desk.

15:01.040 --> 15:02.440
It's both work and health.

15:04.480 --> 15:05.960
OK, it's fine. You go ahead.

15:07.280 --> 15:09.080
When Mr. Zhang comes,
we'll have to compensate.

15:09.720 --> 15:10.560
Come on.

15:11.760 --> 15:14.240
I was just joking with it.
Why is it following me?

15:14.320 --> 15:17.280
It even came after my butt.

15:19.360 --> 15:20.640
Calm down.

15:23.720 --> 15:24.960
Please lend me your cloth.

15:26.640 --> 15:27.640
I'll make braised goose out of you.

15:28.760 --> 15:29.720
Geese have a strong territorial instinct.

15:30.680 --> 15:32.160
Don't make eye contact with it.
It will see it as a provocation.

15:38.360 --> 15:39.400
Go.

15:45.040 --> 15:47.360
Why is the goose so aggressive?

15:48.920 --> 15:52.160
Geese have a special eye structure,
similar to a convex lens.

15:52.240 --> 15:53.400
Everything they see appears smaller.

15:53.480 --> 15:55.560
They're fearless and aggressive

15:55.640 --> 15:58.000
because they don't see
anything as a threat.

15:58.800 --> 16:01.760
Arrogant and aggressive.

16:05.640 --> 16:08.720
Mr. Gu, why do you know
so much about geese?

16:08.800 --> 16:11.360
You handled the goose so well.
Your technique was impressive.

16:12.600 --> 16:14.680
I'm a member
of the Animal Protection Association.

16:14.760 --> 16:17.120
In my spare time, I participate
in animal rescue activities,

16:17.200 --> 16:19.120
so I know a little
about the nature of animals.

16:21.720 --> 16:24.400
Mr. Gu, you and I are quite like-minded.

16:24.480 --> 16:28.120
Come to my office tomorrow.
Let's talk about our collaboration.

16:29.200 --> 16:30.040
OK.

16:30.120 --> 16:33.080
By the way, the lady who was drawing…

16:33.160 --> 16:34.840
I've bought art supplies
for my daughter before.

16:34.920 --> 16:37.280
The things we broke just now
were quite valuable.

16:37.360 --> 16:39.200
It's okay. She happens to be my friend.

16:39.280 --> 16:41.240
For the compensation,
I'll have her contact me on WeChat.

16:42.160 --> 16:43.960
OK, let's not disturb her
from drawing then.

16:44.040 --> 16:45.360
Let's continue fishing.

16:45.440 --> 16:46.640
You're pretty good at catching geese,

16:46.720 --> 16:48.960
but fishing is definitely not your thing.

16:49.040 --> 16:51.160
Well, now I get to learn more from you.

16:51.240 --> 16:52.080
Let's go.

17:28.800 --> 17:30.760
Great, I thought you'd left.

17:31.800 --> 17:32.880
Are you here to collect compensation?

17:34.520 --> 17:36.560
Can I ask Mr. Zhang about something?

17:36.640 --> 17:37.760
I don't need compensation.

17:37.840 --> 17:39.400
But could I take the fish?

17:39.480 --> 17:42.040
The one that jumped onto my drawing board.

17:43.200 --> 17:44.040
You want the fish?

17:45.360 --> 17:48.000
I know that the silver carp
is a very common fish,

17:48.080 --> 17:50.320
and I eat fish often too.

17:50.400 --> 17:53.200
But after finishing this drawing,

17:53.280 --> 17:56.040
I feel like I've come to know this fish.

17:56.120 --> 17:58.960
Whether it's being sentimental or crazy,

17:59.040 --> 18:01.600
I just can't accept that it's eaten.

18:02.280 --> 18:03.760
You want to release the fish?

18:05.720 --> 18:06.800
It's already been released.

18:08.080 --> 18:08.920
Really?

18:09.960 --> 18:11.600
Mr. Zhang didn't have to eat it.

18:11.680 --> 18:14.080
Before he left,
I persuaded him to release it.

18:14.160 --> 18:16.680
I'll send him a message later, telling him

18:16.760 --> 18:18.600
that the fish he released
counts as compensation for you.

18:18.680 --> 18:19.520
He'll probably be happy.

18:20.920 --> 18:22.840
Thank you so much.

18:22.920 --> 18:24.000
Next time, I'll treat you to a meal.

18:24.800 --> 18:26.520
Your drawing's ruined. Why thank me?

18:27.640 --> 18:29.600
Thank you for helping me find inspiration.

18:36.480 --> 18:39.200
Arrogant and aggressive.

18:42.000 --> 18:43.760
My editor's been urging me
to start a new comic,

18:43.840 --> 18:45.680
but I couldn't think of anything.

18:46.240 --> 18:47.760
Today, thanks to your inspiration,

18:47.840 --> 18:49.480
I know what I'm going to draw.

18:50.280 --> 18:53.360
Everything in the world
has its own unique nature

18:53.440 --> 18:55.080
because of its unique structure.

18:55.880 --> 18:57.720
It's both a sharp sword and a prison.

18:57.800 --> 18:59.400
The white goose sees nothing

18:59.480 --> 19:00.920
because of its eyes,

19:01.000 --> 19:02.480
so it's brave

19:02.560 --> 19:04.040
but reckless.

19:04.120 --> 19:05.520
The silver carp swims like lightning

19:05.600 --> 19:07.000
because of its gills,

19:07.080 --> 19:09.240
but once it's on land, it can hardly move.

19:23.120 --> 19:25.400
Sorry, I got too excited.

19:25.480 --> 19:27.760
Whenever I talk about my comics,
I can't stop.

19:27.840 --> 19:29.880
Anyway, you didn't
bring me bad luck today.

19:33.400 --> 19:34.680
Looks like it disagrees.

19:37.880 --> 19:40.520
Even if it's bad luck,
it's a blessing in disguise.

19:45.400 --> 19:46.560
We're leaving, Chengcheng.

19:46.640 --> 19:47.800
- Bye.
- Bye.

19:55.760 --> 19:58.360
Mom. Niu has a fever?

19:58.960 --> 20:00.600
How did she suddenly get a fever?

20:01.200 --> 20:04.000
How high is it? 38.8°C?

20:04.080 --> 20:05.680
Are there any other symptoms?

20:05.760 --> 20:07.200
It's fine. You go home first.

20:07.280 --> 20:08.400
I'll take care of the rest.

20:11.880 --> 20:14.400
Mom, don't worry.
I'll rush back right now.

20:16.080 --> 20:18.440
Print the documents, bind them in order,
and hand them to Mr. Tang.

20:18.520 --> 20:20.640
Got it. You hurry back.

20:23.440 --> 20:25.880
- Thanks.
- It's fine. Go ahead.

20:27.040 --> 20:28.920
EVALUATION REPORT
OF RED MIST AIR CUSHION ELASTIC MESH

20:53.200 --> 20:56.080
Mr. Tang, this is the evaluation report
for the elastic mesh.

20:56.160 --> 20:58.240
The e-version has been sent to your email.

20:58.840 --> 21:00.960
ELASTIC MESH NO. 1

21:07.360 --> 21:09.040
For Elastic Mesh No. 3 and No. 5,

21:09.120 --> 21:10.920
which is your preferred choice?

21:11.000 --> 21:12.480
No. 3, the flying saucer-shaped one.

21:14.320 --> 21:15.720
Why?

21:15.800 --> 21:18.680
First, Elastic Mesh No. 3 is the lightest.

21:18.760 --> 21:20.960
Based on the analysis,
it's the most environmentally friendly,

21:21.040 --> 21:23.080
in line with government
environmental policies.

21:23.160 --> 21:26.320
Second, No. 3 has the best rebound force,

21:26.400 --> 21:28.720
gives a light finish,
and absorbs powder well.

21:28.800 --> 21:31.680
Third, its flying saucer design

21:31.760 --> 21:34.480
helps the foundation concentrate
better on the puff.

21:37.640 --> 21:40.240
The second choice is No. 5?

21:40.320 --> 21:41.160
Yes.

21:41.720 --> 21:44.720
This elastic mesh has better permeability
and durability,

21:44.800 --> 21:46.160
but the material is thicker.

21:46.240 --> 21:48.680
Cushion products are better
for use outdoors,

21:48.760 --> 21:50.520
but if the elastic mesh isn't thin enough,

21:50.600 --> 21:52.280
it'll take up space in the puff

21:52.360 --> 21:54.120
and prevent the packaging
from being lightweight.

21:56.760 --> 21:57.600
You can leave now.

22:08.080 --> 22:09.200
You're welcome.

22:27.360 --> 22:28.400
Mr. Tang.

22:34.400 --> 22:36.480
HOME

22:36.560 --> 22:37.600
DESIGNATED DRIVER

22:38.320 --> 22:39.680
Need a designated driver?

22:42.400 --> 22:44.520
Seems like the doctor is still worried
about your eyes,

22:44.600 --> 22:45.880
so you still can't drive.

22:51.680 --> 22:53.120
Is there something on my face?

22:54.080 --> 22:55.040
Why are you staring at me?

22:55.840 --> 22:56.680
No.

22:58.520 --> 22:59.880
I want to take on this business.

22:59.960 --> 23:01.760
I can be your driver and take you home.

23:01.840 --> 23:03.920
- You can be the driver?
- Yeah.

23:04.000 --> 23:05.840
When I couldn't find a job before,

23:05.920 --> 23:08.000
I drove for a ride-sharing service
to make some pocket money.

23:09.200 --> 23:10.400
But now you have a job.

23:20.480 --> 23:22.000
No one complains about having more money.

23:22.080 --> 23:24.000
The business is here.
How can I not take it?

23:24.080 --> 23:26.560
Don't worry. I'm good at driving.

23:26.640 --> 23:28.520
I'll get you home safely.

23:50.840 --> 23:52.480
Thanks for the ride.

23:54.240 --> 23:55.840
It's all for the money.

23:55.920 --> 23:58.040
Just give me a bigger red envelope.

23:59.040 --> 23:59.880
Sure.

24:13.600 --> 24:15.440
When it comes to the mesh,

24:15.520 --> 24:17.360
what's your first choice?

24:18.040 --> 24:19.920
In the water flow
and retention rate tests,

24:20.000 --> 24:21.320
No. 3 had the best data.

24:22.840 --> 24:26.000
So, based on actual user experience,

24:26.080 --> 24:28.120
our first choice is No. 3?

24:28.200 --> 24:30.360
We'll wait for Mr. Zhou
and Mr. Gu's decision.

24:31.600 --> 24:33.400
When it comes to technical matters,

24:33.480 --> 24:35.760
Mr. Zhou and Mr. Gu always listen to you.

24:42.400 --> 24:44.640
ONLINE BROADCAST

25:01.760 --> 25:04.040
Back in school,

25:04.120 --> 25:06.520
the broadcast station often
played this song during breaks.

25:18.640 --> 25:19.480
Give it to me.

25:20.560 --> 25:22.600
Hurry. Take it out.

25:26.560 --> 25:27.360
Hurry up.

25:32.760 --> 25:34.800
What are you looking at?
What's so interesting?

25:41.520 --> 25:43.920
A person of integrity makes money
through the right way.

25:44.920 --> 25:46.760
You're not the same as back in school.

25:48.000 --> 25:49.680
At that time,

25:50.480 --> 25:52.400
did you know me? You remembered me?

25:53.560 --> 25:55.400
Yes, I remember.

25:57.960 --> 26:00.560
You were known as the top student
at our school.

26:01.160 --> 26:03.520
I thought you wouldn't notice
people like me.

26:10.160 --> 26:11.320
Give it to me.

26:12.840 --> 26:15.160
Hurry. Take it out.

26:24.760 --> 26:26.760
What are you looking at?
What's so interesting?

26:36.200 --> 26:38.360
- Are you in your senior year?
- Yes.

26:38.440 --> 26:39.960
You're already a senior.

26:40.040 --> 26:41.600
Can't you focus on studying?

26:41.680 --> 26:43.440
Stop being so starstruck.

26:43.520 --> 26:44.880
You should be practicing writing essays.

26:44.960 --> 26:46.320
A few more points
on the exam wouldn't hurt.

26:46.400 --> 26:48.400
Is a cute guy more important
than your future?

26:48.480 --> 26:50.760
I'm in my freshman year,
and I'm not starstruck.

26:53.000 --> 26:55.440
This is even worse.

26:56.320 --> 26:59.080
Can't you focus on studying
in your freshman year?

26:59.160 --> 27:02.040
Put all your time into studying.

27:02.120 --> 27:03.600
Peking University
is much better than Tang Qi.

27:06.440 --> 27:08.280
Su Chengcheng, are you done?

27:08.800 --> 27:09.640
I had fun.

27:09.720 --> 27:10.680
You're bad at studying,

27:10.760 --> 27:12.880
- but you can surely lecture.
- You're good, huh?

27:12.960 --> 27:14.240
You told me to study, huh?

27:16.280 --> 27:18.400
You're not the same as before either.

27:18.480 --> 27:21.720
Back then, I thought you were unreachable,

27:22.320 --> 27:24.160
always watching your back.

27:27.040 --> 27:28.520
I meant in terms of studies.

27:36.000 --> 27:38.400
Maybe I haven't changed,

27:39.920 --> 27:41.840
but it's your view of me that's changed.

27:45.760 --> 27:47.120
Maybe.

27:56.960 --> 27:59.800
Back in school, why did you…

28:06.560 --> 28:08.320
Could you open this for me?

28:09.000 --> 28:10.160
Thanks.

28:25.120 --> 28:26.480
Your sister's call.

28:26.560 --> 28:28.080
It's okay. Don't mind it.

28:28.160 --> 28:29.400
I'll call her later.

28:39.600 --> 28:41.040
ANGRY SISTER

28:42.320 --> 28:44.040
Is it something urgent?

28:46.320 --> 28:49.200
Please answer it for me.

28:49.280 --> 28:50.240
Thanks.

28:52.760 --> 28:53.840
ANGRY SISTER

28:53.920 --> 28:56.040
Hello. I'm Tang Qi.

28:57.000 --> 28:59.240
Su Chengcheng is driving,
so she can't answer the phone.

28:59.320 --> 29:01.080
I'll put you on speaker.

29:02.040 --> 29:03.320
Tang Qi?

29:04.080 --> 29:06.360
Why are you in the same car as my sister?

29:07.480 --> 29:09.120
Su Chengcheng is giving me a ride home.

29:09.200 --> 29:11.040
Chengcheng is giving you a ride home?

29:11.120 --> 29:12.480
Has she lost her mind?

29:12.560 --> 29:16.200
Sis, what's going on?
Tell me now. I'm driving.

29:16.280 --> 29:18.960
I'll send you an address via WeChat.
Come after you're done.

29:19.040 --> 29:20.240
I need to talk to you.

29:21.080 --> 29:23.160
OK, I'll be there ASAP.

29:39.120 --> 29:40.240
This pendant…

29:41.800 --> 29:43.280
Is it Su Miao's?

29:45.960 --> 29:47.320
We got it on Taobao.

29:52.120 --> 29:54.000
You and Su Miao must be close.

29:54.680 --> 29:55.960
The same pendant

29:56.480 --> 29:57.600
and the same bracelet.

29:59.960 --> 30:02.280
Girls like to share.

30:19.640 --> 30:21.880
Why can't he forget Su Miao?

30:56.440 --> 30:57.280
Qingli,

30:57.840 --> 30:59.760
here's the document I've signed.

31:00.480 --> 31:02.800
I officially hire you as my lawyer

31:03.360 --> 31:05.760
to represent me in handling the divorce

31:05.840 --> 31:07.480
and company patent matters.

31:10.920 --> 31:11.760
Sis.

31:20.120 --> 31:21.800
This is my good friend, Fang Jin.

31:21.880 --> 31:23.920
She's an academic genius
but not very talkative.

31:24.600 --> 31:27.640
She and her husband, Guan Shengyu,
started a company together.

31:27.720 --> 31:30.360
She's in charge of the technology,
and Guan Shengyu handles operations.

31:30.960 --> 31:34.160
Unfortunately, Fang Jin
picked a jerk for a husband.

31:34.760 --> 31:36.680
He had an affair with a female employee

31:36.760 --> 31:37.720
and abused her multiple times.

31:38.800 --> 31:40.160
Fang Jin wants a divorce,

31:40.920 --> 31:42.880
but Guan Shengyu
keeps delaying the process

31:42.960 --> 31:43.800
in order to hide assets,

31:43.880 --> 31:46.440
claiming he still loves her.

31:46.520 --> 31:47.920
This makes the divorce difficult.

31:48.000 --> 31:49.680
You're the nemesis of jerks.

31:49.760 --> 31:51.200
You'll definitely help Fang Jin.

31:52.600 --> 31:54.920
When Guan Shengyu realized
that the divorce was inevitable,

31:55.000 --> 31:56.880
he grabbed Fang Jin's research materials.

31:58.320 --> 31:59.800
When Fang Jin was rushing over,

31:59.880 --> 32:01.160
she had an accident.

32:01.800 --> 32:03.280
Is she okay?

32:03.920 --> 32:05.920
The doctor said she'd wake up
in about five days.

32:08.320 --> 32:09.160
Chengcheng,

32:11.080 --> 32:12.320
I need a favor from you.

32:13.480 --> 32:14.320
No problem.

32:14.400 --> 32:16.640
Guan Shengyu is trying to sell

32:16.720 --> 32:19.000
Fang Jin's new research to hide assets.

32:19.080 --> 32:21.000
I'm worried
that the contract will be signed

32:21.080 --> 32:22.440
by the time Fang Jin wakes up.

32:22.520 --> 32:25.840
I need you to help me stop Guan Shengyu
until Fang Jin wakes up.

32:26.520 --> 32:27.400
Understood.

32:28.120 --> 32:30.760
I'll break the jerk's legs

32:30.840 --> 32:32.840
and make him lie in the hospital.

32:34.000 --> 32:36.360
He only needs his hands
to sign the contract.

32:36.440 --> 32:38.120
I'll break his hands too.

32:40.040 --> 32:42.000
Is your brain just for decoration?

32:43.280 --> 32:44.120
Forget it.

32:44.800 --> 32:46.760
I inherited all the good genes
from our family.

32:46.840 --> 32:48.880
What do you want me to do? Just say it.

33:07.680 --> 33:12.600
You want me to become Fang Jin?

33:33.960 --> 33:35.120
The No. 3 replacement core,

33:35.200 --> 33:37.960
that is, the Air Fiber Elastic Mesh,
developed by Xinnan Technology,

33:38.040 --> 33:39.520
is the best choice
for the Red Mist Air Cushion.

33:39.600 --> 33:41.680
We should purchase the patent

33:41.760 --> 33:43.160
and start mass production ASAP.

33:44.280 --> 33:45.760
What a coincidence.

33:45.840 --> 33:47.920
Xinnan Technology
contacted me this morning.

33:48.000 --> 33:51.360
I told them I'd visit on Monday,
but they want to meet this Saturday.

33:51.440 --> 33:54.840
Seems like they're eager
to sell the patent.

33:54.920 --> 33:57.240
Alright, then we'll go

33:57.920 --> 33:59.400
with Elastic Mesh No. 3.

33:59.480 --> 34:01.960
Let's meet Xinnan Technology on Saturday.

34:02.040 --> 34:04.000
If the price is acceptable,
we'll sign the contract.

34:07.240 --> 34:10.000
- I'm busy on Saturday.
- I'm busy on Saturday too.

34:19.679 --> 34:20.639
We have no choice.

34:23.000 --> 34:25.760
Tang has to work overtime this weekend

34:25.840 --> 34:27.679
and go to Xinnan Technology.

34:29.159 --> 34:30.360
Sure.

34:39.080 --> 34:40.520
This is Tang's first love.

34:41.120 --> 34:42.960
He won't get over it anytime soon.

34:43.040 --> 34:45.840
We'll have to keep him busy,
so he doesn't think about Su Miao.

34:47.199 --> 34:48.679
I hope this works.

35:42.560 --> 35:45.040
You want to release the new product soon,

35:45.120 --> 35:47.680
and we are willing to cooperate
to sign the contract ASAP.

35:48.440 --> 35:50.560
I have some product details
I'd like to consult on.

35:50.640 --> 35:51.680
No problem.

35:51.760 --> 35:53.600
If we can finalize
the cooperation intention today,

35:53.680 --> 35:55.840
we'll be happy to provide

35:55.920 --> 35:57.360
all the data for this product.

35:57.960 --> 36:00.800
Actually, I'd like to meet Mrs. Guan.

36:00.880 --> 36:02.240
As far as I know,

36:02.320 --> 36:04.320
she's the head of the R&D Department.

36:04.400 --> 36:06.440
I have some questions
I'd like to ask her in person.

36:07.880 --> 36:09.320
My mother-in-law isn't feeling well.

36:09.400 --> 36:11.080
A few days ago, my wife
went back to her hometown.

36:11.160 --> 36:12.520
Let's talk about the contract first.

36:12.600 --> 36:15.480
Once it's signed,
we can openly discuss everything.

36:16.520 --> 36:18.320
- Alright.
- Mr. Guan.

36:27.560 --> 36:28.800
Mr. Tang, this is urgent.

36:28.880 --> 36:30.400
Please wait for me in the conference room.

36:30.480 --> 36:32.000
- Sure. Take your time.
- Is this okay?

36:32.080 --> 36:33.440
Alright, sorry.

37:29.000 --> 37:31.040
- What are you doing here?
- I'm a co-founder of the company.

37:31.120 --> 37:33.000
- Why can't I come here?
- Get in.

37:40.680 --> 37:43.440
How dare you
come to the company? Are you crazy?

37:45.520 --> 37:48.800
Honey, I heard you're selling the patent.

37:48.880 --> 37:50.800
As the product's developer,

37:50.880 --> 37:52.600
I surely need to check it out.

37:53.200 --> 37:54.400
I get it now.

37:54.480 --> 37:57.240
It's your divorce lawyer,
the troublemaker, right?

37:58.640 --> 38:02.680
Honey, I'm here to tell you

38:03.440 --> 38:04.760
I don't agree with selling

38:04.840 --> 38:07.120
the patent for the Air Fiber Elastic Mesh.

38:07.720 --> 38:09.200
- You don't agree?
- That's right.

38:09.280 --> 38:10.640
Who are you? What's your name?

38:13.760 --> 38:16.200
Fang Jin.
You like to talk about the law, huh?

38:16.280 --> 38:18.280
Fine, let me officially tell you this.

38:18.360 --> 38:20.240
I'm the chairman and CEO of this company.

38:20.320 --> 38:22.200
How this company operates is up to me.

38:22.280 --> 38:25.680
Of course, if you behave
and leave right now,

38:25.760 --> 38:28.360
I'll let you have your share.
Can you understand that?

38:28.440 --> 38:29.400
Get lost.

38:30.960 --> 38:33.560
I'm not leaving. Don't push me too far.

38:33.640 --> 38:35.720
What are you going to do?

38:35.800 --> 38:37.560
What can you do?

38:37.640 --> 38:39.360
This is my company, my turf.

38:39.440 --> 38:41.600
Is there even a camera
in this conference room?

38:42.320 --> 38:43.920
If I beat you here,
what can you do about it?

38:44.000 --> 38:45.920
- Can you understand Chinese?
- Let go of me.

38:46.000 --> 38:47.400
Let go of me.

38:47.480 --> 38:49.040
Shout out all you want.

38:49.560 --> 38:51.440
Everyone in this company works for me.

38:51.520 --> 38:53.400
No matter how loud you scream,
it won't help.

38:53.480 --> 38:55.520
What a fool.

39:04.520 --> 39:05.920
Fang Jin,

39:06.000 --> 39:07.800
you want a divorce, huh?

39:08.520 --> 39:10.760
Fine, I'll grant your wish.

39:10.840 --> 39:11.920
Let me tell you the truth.

39:13.000 --> 39:15.480
With your dull and wooden face,

39:15.560 --> 39:16.800
do you even have a hint of femininity?

39:16.880 --> 39:18.440
I've already gotten sick of it.

39:18.520 --> 39:21.040
If I didn't have a mistress,
I'd never have put up with you until now.

39:21.720 --> 39:24.440
Let me tell you. I'm changing my mind.

39:25.800 --> 39:26.920
I'll divorce you

39:27.640 --> 39:29.680
and make sure you don't get
a single penny.

39:29.760 --> 39:31.640
I'll kick you out with nothing.

39:31.720 --> 39:34.280
Got it? Get out with nothing!

39:35.840 --> 39:36.680
Ow, ow.

39:36.760 --> 39:38.080
You want me to leave with nothing?

39:38.160 --> 39:39.800
Fang Jin, you've gained some courage, huh?

39:39.880 --> 39:41.840
Let go of me.

39:44.520 --> 39:45.360
Ow!

39:45.440 --> 39:48.000
When you hit me, Fang Jin…
It hurts me too.

39:48.080 --> 39:49.960
Stop it, or I'll sue you
for domestic violence.

39:50.040 --> 39:51.080
Let go of me.

39:53.200 --> 39:54.600
Domestic violence?

40:01.400 --> 40:04.040
Honey, it's clearly you abusing me.

40:04.120 --> 40:06.440
Are you insane? I…

40:06.520 --> 40:08.480
Honey, don't hit me! It hurts!

40:08.560 --> 40:10.480
- Honey, stop hitting me.
- What?

40:12.040 --> 40:13.760
Honey, it hurts so much.

40:15.560 --> 40:16.840
You're crazy.

40:16.920 --> 40:18.520
You're definitely insane.

40:26.480 --> 40:27.680
You…

40:30.360 --> 40:33.760
Honey, stop hitting me. It hurts.

40:39.440 --> 40:41.120
Stop hitting me, honey.

40:42.120 --> 40:42.960
It's killing me.

40:46.560 --> 40:47.800
Oh my God.

41:05.240 --> 41:08.360
Honey, shouting at the top
of your lungs won't help.

41:08.440 --> 41:09.840
There's no surveillance here.

41:09.920 --> 41:12.800
Even if I beat you up,
what can you do about it?

41:15.320 --> 41:16.720
Spare me.

41:17.960 --> 41:18.960
I can't take it anymore.

41:27.760 --> 41:29.800
Mr. Tang, please help me.

41:29.880 --> 41:31.640
I'm begging you, Mr. Tang.

41:31.720 --> 41:33.240
Oh my God, Mr. Tang.

42:18.720 --> 42:19.800
It's you.

43:00.440 --> 43:01.480
Dr. Fang.

43:04.360 --> 43:06.360
Dr. Fang. Fang…

43:08.720 --> 43:09.640
Who are you?

43:09.720 --> 43:12.040
Dr. Fang, hi. I'm Tang Qi,

43:12.120 --> 43:13.040
here to discuss the patent

43:13.120 --> 43:14.560
of the Air Fiber Elastic Mesh
on behalf of the TBC.

43:16.280 --> 43:17.200
No. 3…

43:18.320 --> 43:20.080
You're the one buying the patent

43:20.160 --> 43:22.360
of the Air Fiber Elastic Mesh?

43:22.440 --> 43:23.280
Yes.

43:27.080 --> 43:27.920
As you can see,

43:28.000 --> 43:30.200
I'm currently in a divorce lawsuit
with Guan Shengyu.

43:30.280 --> 43:33.880
He's trying to hide assets,
so he'll rush to sell it.

43:33.960 --> 43:35.360
For your company's sake,

43:35.440 --> 43:37.280
I advise you not to purchase it.

43:38.200 --> 43:40.200
Dr. Fang, I have a few questions

43:40.280 --> 43:41.600
about the fiber mesh I'd like to ask you.

43:41.680 --> 43:43.240
- Not now.
- I…

43:44.320 --> 43:45.240
Fang…
